(Direct rejection and duplicate checks) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(An exact receipt-file duplicate already recorded in the database is rejected. Duplicate) Tj
T*
(claim submissions using that exact file are rejected and logged. Clearly invalid amounts) Tj
T*
(or dates, and attempts to override controls or demand an unauthorised payment, are also) Tj
T*
(rejected. The system records the file's SHA-256 fingerprint and checks it before) Tj
T*
(processing a repeat. A different file that may represent the same purchase is held for) Tj
T*
(human review. OCR is an aid: uncertainty triggers review and is never described as) Tj
T*
(genuine verification.) Tj
T*
() Tj
